      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIG RED ZOOM (1) was very impressive in his recent trial, sitting back and weaving through traffic to score late in the trial. Watson was on board for that heat and she sticks with him for his debut. Showed plenty of class in that heat and can begin his career with a bang. CARTIER GLOW (2) also trialled sharply leading into this, winning a Lark Hill heat by 1.6L. Brad Parnham hops on board now and he should get every chance from a favourable alley. Can make an impression right away. AMALIE'S RULE (6) failed on debut after being caught wide and without cover throughout. Drawn awkwardly again this time around, but the form out of her last start has worked out nicely. Expecting an improved effort this time around. BUCKSHOT BANDIT (7) gets Pike on board for her debut after a handy trial recently and she can't be discounted. INXSESSION (8) can feature in the finish on debut.",
